d concurrent requests from the background worker backfill job.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n- Worker deployment log showing high-concurrency backfill: `worker-1.4.1: one-off refund backfill job (18k refunds) at concurrency 32` sharing the production API key.\\n- Vendor logs: `paygate 429 Too Many Requests retry-after=30 (limit 600/min for key pk_live_…c9)`.\\n- Metrics showing `payments-api.error_rate_pct` jumping from <0.5% to ~38-39% starting at 03:00.\\n\\n## Remediation\\n- Escalate to vendor or throttle the background worker job to respect rate limits.\\n\\n## Follow-ups\\n1. Implement dedicated API keys or rate-limiting for internal background jobs.\\n2. Ensure batch and backfill jobs use exponential backoff and rate limiters natively.\"\n}\n```", "output_ref": null, "tool_calls": [], "output_tokens": 863, "latency_ms": 3277, "input_tokens": 21352, "cached": true, "provider": "gemini"}
